title: IBM TS4300: Library Information
agents: snmp
author: Kuhn & Rueß GmbH <info@kuhn-ruess.de>
license: GPL
distribution: none
description:
 Reports the inventory data of an IBM TS4300 tape library from the
 product group of the SNIA-SML-MIB (.1.3.6.1.4.1.14851.3.1.3): model,
 serial number, vendor, firmware version and description.

 The service is purely informational and always OK. The operational
 state of the library is monitored by the check {ibm_ts4300_library}.

 The TS4300 does not answer the standard sysDescr OID, so the host needs
 the rule "Hosts without system description OID" for any of these checks
 to be discovered.

inventory:
 One service per host.
